request.description:
Get all alarms for the authenticated user.

**Note:** Alarms are automatically generated from medicines.
Returns medicine schedules formatted as alarms.

**Response Format:**
```json
{
  "medicine_id": {
    "name": "Medicine Name",
    "days_of_week": [1,2,3,4,5,6,7],
    "time": ["08:00", "20:00"]
  }
}
```
